License Scope
For clarity:
/Software → MIT License
/Docs → CC BY-SA 4.0
/Guide → CC BY-SA 4.0 (the printed build guides)
/3D → CERN-OHL-S-2.0
Source code anywhere in the repository → MIT License, by its nature rather than its folder
Photoplasm branding, unpublished know-how, confidential material, and separately protected inventions → Not included in these blanket licenses
Where an individual file contains an explicit license notice that differs from this document, the license notice contained in that file governs that file.
